; ISSUE-016: a defvar initialized with an aggregate defconst is refused, though
; docs/toplevel.md says naming one "runs at startup". Actual: "defvar: a Fx slot
; must be initialized with a (Fx ...) compound literal".
; fixed-when: runs
(defstruct Fx v:i32)
(defconst ZERO (Fx 0))
(defvar g:Fx ZERO)
(defn main ():i32 (g 'v))
